	(text "Buttons/LEDs via MCP23017 (I2C 0x20). GPA7/GPB7 are output-only.\nINTA -> EXP_INT (ESP32 IO39), use IOCON.MIRROR so INTA covers both ports.\nButtons pull to GND: enable GPPU pull-ups in firmware.\nLED resistors chosen for 3.3V drive; tune after testing actual LEDs."
